			dependencies: ["1908E5992649B221"]
			description: ["Created from tossing a diamond into Spirit Fire, Spirit Attuned Gems are used in a variety of recipes, the most notable being Spirit Attuned Crystals. Like candles and skulls, these are used in the creation of certain pentacles used during rituals,"]
