		}
		{
			dependencies: ["76E6E295FDCA2A3D"]
			description: ["With the pentacle Eziveus's Spectral Repulsion, some silver, and a bit of gold, your glass lenses can be bound to a foliot, allowing you to then craft otherworld goggles. While these goggles allow one to &osee&r otherworld materials, they are unable to &omine&r the materials. For that, a special pickaxe is required."]
