		{
			dependencies: ["349C149AE25E469C"]
			description: [
				"A Foliot Transporter is a Foliot bound to a book of calling with the purpose of taking items from one inventory, such as a chest, and putting them in another inventory, such as that of a crusher spirit."
				"Shift Right Clicking the spirit will let you change its filter, which by default is set to only allow items added to its list, but that can be changed to the opposite if you desire. To set its inventories, right click the Book of Calling obtained by the ritual, then make sure you have either Set Extract or Set Deposit selected. After that, shift right click the container or mob you want the spirit to take from or give to. It should be known that for blocks like furnaces, it's important you right click the correct face. For example, right clicking the back of a furnace will have the transporter deposit items into the fuel slot of a furnace."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:chest_minecart"
			id: "3064519CF5EDABDD"
			rewards: [{
